#. 【開ける方法】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[how to open it]"
msgstr ""

#. 開ける方法に見当が付いてるって…
#. 何か仕掛けでも見つけたの？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You know how to open it? Did you figure out some kind\n"
"of trick or something?"
msgstr ""

#. 簡単な仕掛けよ…
#. 仕掛けと呼ぶのもためらわれる程のね…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"A very easy trick, yes. So easy, I'm not sure you can\n"
"even call it a trick..."
msgstr ""

#. そこのパソコンに、
#. それらしいプログラムがあったのよ。
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I saw a program on that PC that I think controls it."
msgstr ""

#. 正しいパスワードを入力すれば、
#. あのドアが開くはず……なんだけど…
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Enter the right password, and the door should open\n"
"right up."
msgstr ""

#. でも、肝心のパスワードの方がさっぱりなのよ。
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But I don't have a clue what that password might be."
msgstr ""

#. 数字とアルファベットを使うって事しか
#. わからないんじゃ、どうしようもないわ…
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"All we know is it's probably made up of letters and/or\n"
"numbers. We can't really go from there..."
msgstr ""

#. 手掛かりが…少な過ぎるんだね…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're right, that's not nearly enough to go on..."
msgstr ""

#. そのパソコンから彼の個人情報を漁って、
#. 色々と試したりしたんだけど…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I looked through all his paperwork, all the files on\n"
"the PC, everything I could think of."
msgstr ""

#. それでも、ダメだった…
#. 知りたくもない彼の情報に詳しくなっただけ…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I learned more about him than I had any desire to, but\n"
"nothing that might have been his password..."
msgstr ""

#. まったく…無駄骨ね…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "When I think of how much time I wasted on this..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Thật là...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>隠し部屋か…
#. 霧切さんが“心残り”に思うのも当然だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So there's a hidden room she couldn't get into. That's\n"
"what she meant by regret...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園長の個室の隠し部屋なんて、
#. いかにも、手掛かりがありそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think we can assume that there must be some kind of\n"
"clue waiting in there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかしたら、彼女にとっては、
#. それだけの理由じゃないのかもしれないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But maybe for her, there's more to it than that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、あの部屋に辿り着くには、
#. パスワードを解かなきゃならないんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anyway, if we want to get in there, we need to figure\n"
"out the password.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、霧切さんでさえ解除出来ないとなると、
#. ボクなんかに歯が立つ訳…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And if Kyoko can't figure it out, no way do I stand a\n"
"chance...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…いや、待てよ。
#. もしかしたら、あるかもしれない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...No, wait. There might be a chance...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園長の個室のパスワード…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The password could be...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが試してない可能性…
#. もしくは、試したくない可能性…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something Kyoko wouldn't have thought of. Or something\n"
"she didn't *want* to think of...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>例えば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For example...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんの名前とか…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What about your name?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Hả?"

#. …いや、パスワードの事なんだけどさ、
#. もしかしたらと思って…
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh, sorry. I was just trying to think of what the\n"
"password might be."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり…試してないんだな…
#. でも、無理もないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure she hasn't tried it. I mean, it's totally\n"
"understandable...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>お父さんの事をあんな風に言ってた霧切さんが、
#. パスワードに自分の名前を試すなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After the way she talked about her dad, the idea that\n"
"he would use her name as his password.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの性格からして、
#. そんな事出来るはずないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Knowing how she is, I bet the idea never even occurred\n"
"to her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …あのさ、だったら一応、
#. ボクが試してみてもいいかな？
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Umm...do you mind if I try it, just to be sure?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0030 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 別に…私に確認を取る必要なんてないわ…
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's not like you need my permission."
msgstr ""

#. あなたが試したいなら…
#. 好きにすればいいだけの話じゃない…
msgctxt "0032 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If you want to try it, try it. Do whatever you want."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr "Ừ-Ừm..."

#. この部屋…学生の部屋っぽくないって言うか…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This room doesn't really feel like a student's room."
msgstr ""

#. なんだか、大人っぽい雰囲気だけど…
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It has a more...adult atmosphere."
msgstr ""

#. 学園長の個室よ…
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's the headmaster's private room."
msgstr ""

#. …霧切さん！　ここにいたの！？
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko!"
msgstr ""

#. この部屋は、前にも散々調べたけど、
#. まだ、ちょっと<CLT 3>“心残り”<CLT>があってね…
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I've been through this room several times already, but\n"
"I still have one little <CLT 3>regret<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. だから、もう１度だけ…
#. この場所を調べておきたかったの…
msgctxt "0039 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So I decided to check it out one more time."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>え？　心残り…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? A regret...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当に…大丈夫なのかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is she really okay...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さん…相当ショックだったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko...it must have been a complete shock to her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、ボクでさえショックだったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, it was a shock to *me*.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まさか…学園長があんな事になってたなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To find out what happened to the headmaster...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕…間違いなくあいつの仕業だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no doubt the mastermind performed that evil\n"
"deed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あいつが学園長を…霧切さんのお父さんを殺したんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They killed the headmaster—killed Kyoko's father.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>殺した……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They killed him...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…死んだのか、学園長が。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The headmaster...is dead.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 僕達を隔離する計画を立てた希望ヶ峰学園事務局…
#. その事務局の責任者が…
msgctxt "0049 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"The one leading the Hope's Peak staff, the one who\n"
"finalized the plan to isolate you..."
msgstr ""
"Người đứng đầu đội ngũ nhân viên Đỉnh Hy Vọng, người hoàn\n"
"tất kế hoạch cách ly mọi người..."

#. <CLT 3>希望ヶ峰学園長<CLT>だったんだ。
msgctxt "0050 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "...was the <CLT 3>Hope's Peak headmaster<CLT>."
msgstr "...chính là <CLT 3>hiệu trưởng của Đỉnh Hy Vọng<CLT>."

#. つまり、すべてを仕組んだ黒幕は、
#. その学園長って可能性が高いんだ。
msgctxt "0051 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"So that same person may very well be the mastermind\n"
"who planned all this out."
msgstr ""
"Vì vậy, rất có thể chính người đó là kẻ chủ mưu đã vạch ra\n"
"tất cả những chuyện này."

#. ちなみに、その学園長は<CLT 3>３０代後半の男性<CLT>で…
msgctxt "0052 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"And according to the files, the headmaster is <CLT 3>a man\n"
"in his late thirties<CLT>."
msgstr ""
"Bên cạnh đó, theo như các tập tin thì hiệu trưởng là <CLT 3>một\n"
"người đàn ông U40<CLT>..."

#. 今も…<CLT 3>この学園内にいる<CLT>可能性が高いみたいだよ…
msgctxt "0053 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"It seems possible, even likely, that he's <CLT 3>somewhere\n"
"in this school<CLT> right now."
msgstr ""
"Có khả năng rất cao là hiện tại ông ta vẫn đang <CLT 3>ở đâu đó\n"
"trong ngôi trường này<CLT>..."

#. <CLT 4>でも、違ったんだな。
#. 学園長は黒幕じゃなかったんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But we were wrong about that. The headmaster *wasn't*\n"
"the mastermind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、黒幕の正体って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which means the mastermind's true identity is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. クックック…
#. むしろ、ついでにヒントをもう１つやるクマ…
msgctxt "0056 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Kehehe... It's a very polarizing approach, I know,\n"
"but—okay, enough puns. Anyway, here's a hint..."
msgstr ""

#. 確か、前にも言ったと思うクマ…
msgctxt "0057 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'm sure I told you this already, but..."
msgstr ""

#. この<CLT 3>“コロシアイ学園生活”<CLT>の参加者は、
#. 全部で１６人の高校生だけだって…
msgctxt "0058 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...this <CLT 3>killing game<CLT> began with sixteen\n"
"participants, all of them high school students."
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、コロシアイ学園生活が始まった後、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園に生きたまま足を踏み入れた人間も…
msgctxt "0059 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And the only people to take a single step in Hope's\n"
"Peak since the killing game began..."
msgstr ""

#. その１６人だけだったクマ。
msgctxt "0060 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...are those sixteen students."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>玄関ホールに集まっていた１５人に…
#. 戦刃むくろを加えた１６人…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Fifteen of us met in the mail hall. Add Mukuro to the\n"
"mix and you get sixteen.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その中で、今も生き残っているのは、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>ボクを含めた６人<CLT><CLT 4>だけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And including me, only <CLT><CLT 3>six of us<CLT><CLT 4> are still alive.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それ以外のみんなは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Everyone else...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…殺された。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...is dead.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの戦刃むくろだってそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even Mukuro.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女も、間違いなく殺されていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even she's undeniably dead.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、今もこの学園の中に残っているのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So the ones still left alive are...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Tôi."

#. <CLT 4>十神クンと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Byakuya.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Toko.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それと、霧切さん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…その<CLT><CLT 3>６人<CLT><CLT 4>しかいないはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Only <CLT><CLT 3>those six people<CLT><CLT 4> are still alive.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ…やっぱり……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then there's no question...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …いや、そんなはずない！
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait, no! That can't be!"
msgstr ""

#. ボクは…絶対に信じないぞ。
#. 他の可能性だってあるはずだ…
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I refuse to believe it! There has to be some other\n"
"way..."
msgstr ""

#. 絶対…あるに決まってる…！
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "There just HAS to be!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0079 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>霧切さん…
#. 神妙な面持ちって言うか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko looks almost...meek right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>思いつめたような…
#. なんだか話しかけづらい雰囲気だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She must be thinking about something. I probably\n"
"shouldn't bother her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私に確認取る必要なんてないわ。
#. あなたが試したいなら…好きにすればいいじゃない…
msgctxt "0082 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You don't have to ask my permission. If there's\n"
"something you want to do, go ahead and do it."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr "Ừ-Ừm..."

#. <CLT 1>【開ける方法】<CLT>に見当は付いているわ。
#. だけど、その先で行き詰っててね…
msgctxt "0084 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I think I might know <CLT 1>[how to open it]<CLT>. But that's\n"
"where I got stuck."
msgstr ""

#. それが…私の言った<CLT 3>“心残り”<CLT>の事よ…
msgctxt "0085 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Which is the <CLT 3>regret<CLT> I mentioned..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>デスクの上に置かれたパソコン…
#. 電源は入っているみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a PC on the desk. It must have belonged to the\n"
"headmaster...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あの人は、超高校級の絶望について、
#. 色々と調べていたみたいね…
msgctxt "0087 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Whoever used this last, it looks like they were very\n"
"interested in the Ultimate Despair."
msgstr ""

#. そのパソコンには、
#. その調査結果が残っていたわ…
msgctxt "0088 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The PC still has some search results left on it..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、ここに超高校級の絶望の情報が！？
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Then we might be able to get some info on the Ultimate\n"
"Despair!?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、大した情報はないわ。
#. 前に、私があなたに教えた内容と一緒よ…
msgctxt "0090 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There's not much, though. Nothing we don't already\n"
"know."
msgstr ""

#. 超高校級の絶望って言葉は、
#. 個人ではなく、<CLT 3>集団<CLT>を指している…
msgctxt "0091 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"\"The Ultimate Despair isn't one individual, but\n"
"instead points to some kind of <CLT 3>group<CLT>.\""
msgstr ""

#. １年前の<CLT 3>“人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件”<CLT>を
#. 引き起こした連中…
msgctxt "0092 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"\"That group is responsible for <CLT 3>The Tragedy<CLT>, which\n"
"happened one year ago.\""
msgstr ""

#. 絶望だけを行動原理とする、
#. 最低かつ最悪な連中…
msgctxt "0093 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"\"They're the worst sorts of people, whose driving\n"
"force comes from despair...\""
msgstr ""

#. …それだけよ。
#. 大した情報じゃないでしょう？
msgctxt "0094 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And that's all there is. Not much to it, is there?"
msgstr ""

#. この程度しか調べられないなんて…
#. しょせんは霧切家の落ちこぼれ…って事かしら。
msgctxt "0095 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But I guess that's the best he could do as a complete\n"
"Kirigiri failure..."
msgstr ""

#. だ、だけどさ…黒幕に関する情報なら、
#. やっぱり、どんな情報でも助かるって言うか…
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"B-But...any information about the mastermind is\n"
"helpful, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクは…その情報を残してくれた事に
#. 感謝してるよ…
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I appreciate whatever info we can get our hands on."
msgstr ""

#. そう…
msgctxt "0098 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

#. それなら…良かったわね…
msgctxt "0099 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's a good outlook to have."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>超高校級の絶望について<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>The Ultimate Despair<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Thật là...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>まさか、隠し部屋とはな…
#. 霧切さんが“心残り”に思うのも当然だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So there's a hidden room she couldn't get into. That's\n"
"what she meant by regret...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園長の個室の隠し部屋なんて、
#. いかにも、手掛かりがありそうだもんな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think we can assume that there must be some kind of\n"
"clue waiting in there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかしたら、彼女にとっては、
#. それだけの理由じゃないのかもしれないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But maybe for her, there's more to it than that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、その隠し部屋に辿り着くには、
#. パスワードを解かなきゃならないんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anyway, if we want to get in there, we need to figure\n"
"out the password.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、霧切さんでさえ解除出来ないとなると、
#. ボクなんかに歯が立つ訳…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And if Kyoko can't figure it out, no way do I stand a\n"
"chance...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…いや、待てよ。
#. もしかしたら、あるかもしれない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...No, wait. There might be a chance...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園長の個室のパスワード…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The password could be...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが試してない可能性…
#. もしくは、試したくない可能性…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0109 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something Kyoko wouldn't have thought of. Or something\n"
"she didn't *want* to think of...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>例えば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For example...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんの名前とか…？
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What about your name?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0112 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Hả?"

#. …いや、パスワードの事なんだけどさ、
#. もしかしたらと思って…
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh, sorry. I was just trying to think of what the\n"
"password might be."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0114 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり…試してないんだな…
#. でも、無理もないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure she hasn't tried it. I mean, it's totally\n"
"understandable...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>お父さんの事をあんな風に言ってた霧切さんが、
#. パスワードに自分の名前を試すなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0116 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After the way she talked about her dad, the idea that\n"
"he would use her name as his password.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの性格からして、
#. そんな事が出来るはずないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Knowing how she is, I bet the idea never even occurred\n"
"to her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …あのさ、だったら一応、
#. ボクが試してみてもいいかな？
msgctxt "0118 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Umm...do you mind if I try it, just to be sure?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0119 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 別に…私に確認を取る必要なんてないわ…
msgctxt "0120 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's not like you need my permission."
msgstr ""

#. あなたが試したいなら…
#. 好きにすればいいだけの話じゃない…
msgctxt "0121 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If you want to try it, try it. Do whatever you want."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0122 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr "Ừ-Ừm..."

#. <CLT 4>デスクの上に置かれたパソコン…
#. 電源は入っているみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0123 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a PC on the desk. It must have belonged to the\n"
"headmaster...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あの人は、超高校級の絶望について、
#. 色々と調べていたみたいね…
msgctxt "0124 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Whoever used this last, it looks like they were very\n"
"interested in the Ultimate Despair."
msgstr ""

#. そのパソコンには、
#. その調査結果も残っていたわ…
msgctxt "0125 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The PC still has some search results left on it..."
msgstr ""

#. …だけど、大した情報はないわ。
#. 前にあなたに教えた内容と一緒よ…
msgctxt "0126 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There's not much, though. Nothing we don't already\n"
"know."
msgstr ""

#. 超高校級の絶望って言葉は、
#. 個人ではなく<CLT 3>集団<CLT>を指している…
msgctxt "0127 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"\"The Ultimate Despair isn't one individual, but\n"
"instead points to some kind of <CLT 3>group<CLT>.\""
msgstr ""

#. １年前の<CLT 3>“人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件”<CLT>を
#. 引き起こした連中…
msgctxt "0128 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"\"That group is responsible for <CLT 3>The Tragedy<CLT>, which\n"
"happened one year ago.\""
msgstr ""

#. 絶望だけを行動原理とする、
#. 最低かつ最悪な連中…
msgctxt "0129 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"\"They're the worst sorts of people, whose driving\n"
"force comes from despair...\""
msgstr ""

#. この程度よ…
msgctxt "0130 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's all..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、霧切さんの名前を試してみるって、
#. 言ったはいいけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You know, I'm glad I thought of trying Kyoko's name.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もし間違ってたら…
#. それって、彼女を傷付ける事にもなるんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But if that's not it, that might just hurt Kyoko even\n"
"more...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …苗木君、私を気遣う必要なんてないわよ。
msgctxt "0134 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If you're worried about me, Makoto, don't be."
msgstr ""

#. あなたの推理が間違っている事くらい、
#. 最初からわかってるんだし…
msgctxt "0135 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I already know that your guess is wrong."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Ừm..."

#. じゃあ…やるだけやってみるね…
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "In that case, here goes nothin'..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは気を取り直して、
#. パソコンのモニターに向き直った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0138 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I collected myself, then turned to face the computer\n"
"monitor.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ここに…パスワードを打ち込めばいいんだな…
msgctxt "0139 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Lemme just...type the password here..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“霧切響子”…
#. その名前をアルファベットで打ち込んでいく。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0140 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I typed in her full name, \"Kyoko Kirigiri\"...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>緊張した手付きでキーボードを叩き、
#. そして、最後の文字を入力し終えると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0141 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>My hands were tense, slightly trembling, and as I\n"
"finished typing it in...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0142 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Beep* ... *Krrrnnnn*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. え…！？
msgctxt "0143 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "Cái gì...?"

#. 開いた…？
msgctxt "0144 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That did it!?"
msgstr ""

#. …開いたよ、霧切さん！！
msgctxt "0145 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko! It worked!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0146 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0147 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …どうして？
msgctxt "0148 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...Why?"
msgstr ""

#. き、霧切さん…？
msgctxt "0149 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "K-Kyoko...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0150 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>彼女は、ボクには目もくれず、
#. 険しい表情のまま隠し部屋へと消えていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0151 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without looking at me, she disappeared into the hidden\n"
"room. She looked...grim.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切…さん……
msgctxt "0152 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko..."
msgstr "Kyoko..."

#. <CLT 4>デスクの上に置かれたパソコン…
#. 学園長が使っていた物らしい。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0153 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This computer must have belonged to the headmaster.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0154 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの気持ちを考えると…
#. ここは…もう入らない方がいいよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0155 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Thinking about what Kyoko's going through, I can't\n"
"bring myself to disturb her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんには、
#. まだ聞きたい事が色々あるんだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0156 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of stuff I want to talk to her\n"
"about, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0157 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>もう少しだけ、そっとして置いてあげるか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0158 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better give her some more time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ？　壁に妙な隙間があるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0159 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? There's a strange gap in the wall...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>設計ミスとか？　欠陥工事？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0160 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is it some kind of design mistake, or a construction\n"
"defect or something?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ただの隙間じゃないわ。
#. そこから空気が流れて来ているもの…
msgctxt "0161 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There's a gap here, but not just any normal gap...\n"
"I can feel a breeze coming out."
msgstr ""

#. …空気？
msgctxt "0162 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A breeze...?"
msgstr ""

#. きっと、その壁の向こうに空間があるのよ。
msgctxt "0163 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There's likely an open space on the other side\n"
"of this wall."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>空間って…じゃあ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0164 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Open space? Does that mean...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …隠し部屋って事！？
msgctxt "0165 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You mean, like...a hidden room!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 1>【開ける方法】<CLT>に見当は付いている。
msgctxt "0166 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I think I might know <CLT 1>[how to open it]<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、その先で行き詰ってしまった…
#. それが…私の言った<CLT 3>“心残り”<CLT>の事よ…
msgctxt "0167 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But that's where I ended up getting stuck. Which is\n"
"the <CLT 3>regret<CLT> I mentioned..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この壁の向こうに…隠し部屋が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0168 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On the other side of this wall is...a hidden room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 1>【開ける方法】<CLT>に見当は付いているわ。
msgctxt "0169 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I think I might know <CLT 1>[how to open it]<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、その先で行き詰ってしまったわ…
#. それが…私の言った<CLT 3>“心残り”<CLT>の事よ…
msgctxt "0170 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But that's where I ended up getting stuck. Which is\n"
"the <CLT 3>regret<CLT> I mentioned..."
msgstr ""

#. あそこのパソコンに、
#. その扉を開けるためのプログラムがあった…
msgctxt "0171 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I think I saw a program on that PC that may control\n"
"the door."
msgstr ""

#. 正しいパスワードを入力すれば、
#. あのドアが開くはず…なんだけど…
msgctxt "0172 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Enter the right password, and the door should open\n"
"right up."
msgstr ""

#. でも、肝心のパスワードの方がさっぱりなのよ。
msgctxt "0173 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But I don't have a clue what that password might be."
msgstr ""

#. そのパソコンから彼の個人情報を漁って、
#. 色々と試したりもしたんだけど…
msgctxt "0174 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I looked through all his paperwork, all the files on\n"
"the PC, everything I could think of."
msgstr ""

#. でも、ダメだったわ…
#. 知りたくもない彼の情報に詳しくなっただけ…
msgctxt "0175 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I learned more about him than I had any desire to, but\n"
"nothing that might have been his password..."
msgstr ""

#. まったく…無駄骨ね…
msgctxt "0176 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "When I think of how much time I wasted on this..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんには、
#. まだ聞きたい事が色々あるんだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0177 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of stuff I want to talk to her\n"
"about, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0178 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>もう少しだけ、そっとして置いてあげるか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0179 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better give her some more time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>パソコンの置かれたデスクだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0180 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The desk is home to a computer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、学園長が使っていたんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0181 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must have belonged to the headmaster.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>革張りのイスだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0182 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A leather chair...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>生徒が使う雰囲気じゃない。
#. 学園長が使っていたんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0183 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't imagine a student using something like this.\n"
"It must have been the headmaster's.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ…ここで調べるべき事があるよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0184 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think I'm done in here quite yet...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0185 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0186 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0187 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
